Most AI-generated "agent dashboards" look like slop because they borrow patterns from **chatbots** and **SaaS marketing analytics**—glowing "thinking" orbs, fake sparklines, dark-mode glassmorphism, and infinite chat transcripts.

An always-on or persistent agent is not a chatbot. Operationally, it is a **long-lived daemon + state machine + event queue + approval gate**. The best real-world UIs to steal from come from **durable execution engines, autonomous SRE consoles, data orchestrators, and stateful agent runtimes**.

